          "type": "TextualBody",
          "label": "Verso, right margin",
          "value": "\n<ol><li>a fine little mosque built of yellow mud-brick (\u1e6d\u016bb a\u1e63far). Look at [its] qibla (wall)</li>\n<li>above the top of the beard (\u1e25ilya, an architectural term?) on the qibla side . . .</li></ol>\n",
